      "independent_solution": "The selected definition calls sqrt(50) -> 5*sqrt(2) extraction of the factor 5. Since 50 = 25*2 and 5 >= 0, sqrt(50) = sqrt(25)*sqrt(2) = 5*sqrt(2). The square-free factor 2 stays under the radical.",
